<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>New Appointment Booked</title>
  <style>
    body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#eef2eb; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; color:#1a2e24; }
    .wrap { max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#fff; }
    .header { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f3a2b 0%,#1F5F4A 100%); padding:28px 24px; text-align:center; }
    .logo-img { height:42px; width:auto; display:block; margin:0 auto; }
    .tagline { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size:12px; margin:14px 0 0; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .content { padding:32px 28px; }
    h1 { margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px; color:#0f3a2b; }
    p { font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#3d5c4d; }
    .card { background:#f8f7f3; border-left:4px solid #528e77; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 20px; margin:20px 0; }
    .card p { margin:6px 0; font-size:14px; }
    .card strong { color:#1F5F4A; }
    .cta { display:inline-block; background:#1F5F4A; color:#fff !important; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; padding:14px 32px; border-radius:999px; margin:20px 0; }
    .footer { background:#0f3a2b; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9); text-align:center; padding:24px; font-size:12px; }
    .footer a { color:#97BFA5; text-decoration:none; margin:0 8px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="header">
      <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="BENZI" class="logo-img" width="140" height="42" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;border:0;height:42px;width:auto;max-width:160px;" />
      <p class="tagline">New booking</p>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h1>Hello {{recipientName}},</h1>
      <p>A new appointment has been booked on BENZI.</p>
      <div class="card">
        <p><strong>👤 Patient:</strong> {{patientName}}{{#if anonymousMeet}} <em>(anonymous — mic only)</em>{{/if}}</p>
        <p><strong>📅 Date:</strong> {{appointmentDate}}</p>
        <p><strong>🕐 Time:</strong> {{appointmentTime}}</p>
        <p><strong>📍 Location:</strong> {{location}}</p>
        {{#if meetLink}}<p><strong>🎥 Video:</strong> <a href="{{meetLink}}">{{meetLink}}</a></p>{{/if}}
        <p><strong>💵 Price:</strong> Rs. {{price}}</p>
        <p><strong>💳 Payment:</strong> {{paymentMethod}}</p>
      </div>
      <p>Log in to your therapist portal to review and verify payment if needed.</p>
      {{#if appointmentUrl}}
      <div style="text-align:center"><a href="{{appointmentUrl}}" class="cta">Go to Dashboard</a></div>
      {{/if}}
      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The BENZI Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p><strong>BENZI</strong> · &copy; {{currentYear}}</p>
      <p><a href="mailto:support@benzi.com">Support</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
